 **Platforms 5/4:** Neither Platform 5 nor Platform 4 is visible in any of the provided frames.\n*   **Platforms 10/11:** Neither Platform 10 nor Platform 11 is visible in any of the provided frames.\n*   **Platforms 8/9:** Platform **8** is clearly visible in Frame 1. Platform 9 is not visible in any of the provided frames.\n\n**Presence and Location of the Two Young Men:**\n\n*   **Frame 1:** Both young men are present. The man in the red hoodie is standing on the platform, smiling at the camera. The man in the blue cap is holding the camera, taking a selfie with his friend. They are standing on the platform next to the train, which is at Platform 8.\n*   **Frame 5:** The young man in the red hoodie (with the red backpack) is present, standing on the platform, looking towards the train. He is near the sign indicating Platform 6.\n*   **Frame 6:** The same young man in the red hoodie is present, standing on the platform, looking towards the train. He is near the sign indicating Platform 6.\n\nIn summary, Platforms **6** and **8** are visible in the provided frames. The two young men are present in Frames 1, 5, and 6, standing on the platforms near the trains.\n'], 'condensed_response': '**Condensed Scene Summary (Frames\u202f1‑10)**  \n\n| Frame | Visible Platform(s) | Key Visuals | Characters Present & Position |\n|-------|---------------------|-------------|--------------------------------|\n| **1** | Platform\u202f8 (digital display) | Train parked, large “8” sign behind it | Both young men: <br>‑ Red‑hoodie\u202f(standing, smiling) <br>‑ Blue‑cap\u202f(holding the camera, selfie) – together on Platform\u202f8. |\n| **2‑4** | No platform signage visible | Continuation of the train‑platform backdrop | No clear view of the two men (they are off‑screen or out of frame). |\n| **5** | Platform\u202f6 (signpost on far‑left) | Same sign re‑appears, train in background | Red‑hoodie\u202f(now with red backpack) – standing, looking toward the train, positioned next to the