ced by the large digital display showing "8" behind them. However, the question asks about "two platforms" that the vloggers are standing on, which suggests they might be positioned between or across two platforms.\n\nLet me examine more frames around the beginning to see if both platforms 8 and 9 are visible together, as suggested by answer choice D.\n\n```json\n{\n    "tool": "VLM_QUERY",\n    "frames": ["frames/frame_0001.jpg", "frames/frame_0002.jpg", "frames/frame_0003.jpg", "frames/frame_0004.jpg", "frames/frame_0005.jpg", "frames/frame_0006.jpg", "frames/frame_0007.jpg", "frames/frame_0008.jpg", "frames/frame_0009.jpg", "frames/frame_0010.jpg", "frames/frame_0011.jpg", "frames/frame_0012.jpg", "frames/frame_0013.jpg", "frames/frame_0014.jpg", "frames/frame_0015.jpg"],\n    "prompt": "Look carefully at the train station platform configuration. Are the vloggers standing between two platforms (8 and 9)? Check if both platform numbers 8 and 9 are visible simultaneously in any frame. Also verify if the vloggers appear to be positioned on or between two separate platforms rather than just one platform."\n}\n```'}, {'role': 'vlm response', 'content': {'batched_responses': [{'batch_start': 0, 'batch_end': 15, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0001.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0002.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0003.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0004.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0005.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0006.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0007.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0008.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0009.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0010.jp